Z||000022||Jackalrr||12-22-2000||02:36 PM||||I just saw a car the other day (not fiero) infront of Target with a neon light mounted just under his back bumper, it was wired up to his brake lights so it only came on when he applied the brake. His car looked kidna odd though. It has <A HREF="http://www.bradiscool.com" TARGET=_blank>www.bradiscool.com</A>  on each door and his license plate says BRADZ24. <P>I am playing with the idea of trying something like that on the back of my car if I can figure out how he did it so the neon light came on instantly without flickering.<P>-Charlie||||reg||1
